    <string name="faq">FAQ</string>
    <string name="faq_title">Frequently asked questions</string>
    <string name="faq_subtitle">Answers to common questions about Langer Lines.</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How does Langer lines detection work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">The app uses the camera to capture skin images. A Structure Tensor algorithm analyzes collagen fiber orientation in the dermis and traces tension lines.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">How do I edit my profile?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Go to the Profile screen via navigation bar. You can update your photo, email, and personal info.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">How do I delete my account?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Go to Settings → Data &amp; Privacy → Delete profile. All your data will be permanently deleted.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">How do I manage notifications?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">You can toggle notifications in Settings → Notifications.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">Is my data safe?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Yes. All data is transmitted with HTTPS encryption. Images are associated exclusively with your account.</string>
    <string name="faq_q6">How are photos handled?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Photos are used exclusively for Langer line analysis. They are not shared with third parties or used for AI training.</string>
    <string name="faq_q7">Can I use the app for medical diagnoses?</string>
    <string name="faq_a7">No. Langer Lines is a support tool and does not replace professional clinical evaluation.</string>
    <string name="faq_q8">What if I forget my password?</string>
    <string name="faq_a8">On login screen, select \'Forgot Password\' and enter your email to receive a reset link.</string>
    <string name="faq_q9">What is collagen and why is it important?</string>
    <string name="faq_a9">Collagen is the primary structural protein in skin. Its fibers align along Langer lines, providing strength and elasticity.</string>
    <string name="faq_q10">Which body areas can I analyze?</string>
    <string name="faq_a10">You can analyze face, forehead, cheek, arms, hands, chest, abdomen, and legs.</string>
    <string name="faq_q11">How do I watch video tutorials?</string>
    <string name="faq_a11">Go to Settings → Video Tutorials.</string>
    <string name="faq_q12">Can I export my history to PDF?</string>
    <string name="faq_a12">Yes. Go to Profile → Your Data → Export Data to generate a PDF report.</string>
    <string name="faq_q13">Is the app available in other languages?</string>
    <string name="faq_a13">Yes, you can change the language at any time from Settings → Language.</string>
    <string name="faq_q14">What does the tension level mean?</string>
    <string name="faq_a14">The tension level (Low, Medium, High) summarizes the average intensity of Langer lines detected.</string>
